# ServiConnect Environment Variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# DEVELOPMENT: Copy to .env and fill values
# PRODUCTION:  These come from AWS Secrets Manager + Parameter Store
#              DO NOT commit .env to git
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# App
PORT=5000
NODE_ENV=development
APP_NAME=serviconnect

# AWS (for local dev, set your profile or keys)
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=     ← Use IAM role in production (never hardcode)
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY= ← Use IAM role in production (never hardcode)

# JWT (in production → AWS Secrets Manager: serviconnect/app-secrets)
JWT_SECRET=replace_with_long_random_string_min_32_chars
JWT_EXPIRE=7d

# PostgreSQL (in production → AWS Secrets Manager: serviconnect/db-credentials)
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_NAME=serviconnect
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASS=your_local_postgres_password

# Frontend URL (in production → SSM Parameter: /serviconnect/frontend-url)
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5000

# AWS Bedrock AI (in production → SSM Parameter Store)
BEDROCK_REGION=us-east-1
BEDROCK_MODEL_ID=anthropic.claude-3-haiku-20240307-v1:0

# AWS Cognito (in production → SSM Parameter Store)
COGNITO_USER_POOL_ID=
COGNITO_CLIENT_ID=

# AWS SES Email (in production → SSM Parameter Store)
SES_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@yourdomain.com

# DynamoDB tables (in production → SSM Parameter Store)
DYNAMODB_CHAT_TABLE=
DYNAMODB_LOCATION_TABLE=
